# =====================================================================
#  .gitignore for TwinCAT 3 (PLC/NC) + TwinCAT HMI (TE2000) projects
#  Keeps only source code and project files in the repository.
# =====================================================================

# ---- Visual Studio / TwinCAT XAE user and temporary files ----
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.~u
*.bak
*.orig
*.tmp

# ---- TwinCAT 3 PLC / system build output ----
_Boot/
_CompileInfo/
_Libraries/
_Deployment/
_ModuleInstall/
*.compileinfo
*.tmcRefac
LineIDs.dbg
LineIDs.dbg.bak

# ---- TwinCAT license files (never publish) ----
*.tclrs

# ---- TwinCAT HMI build, publish and engineering output ----
**/bin/
**/obj/
.engineering_servers/
**/.hmiframework/
**/.hmipkgs/
Packages/
*.log
tchmipublish.journal.json
liveview_*
*.cache
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.pid

# ---- Security: HMI server private key and user password hashes ----
# These files are regenerated by TwinCAT HMI Engineering on first build.
**/Server/TcHmiSrv/TcHmiSrv.Config.default.json
**/Server/TcHmiUserManagement/TcHmiUserManagement.Config.default.json

# ---- Measurement / logged data (may contain experimental data) ----
TwinCAT Measurement Project*/
*.svdx
*.csv
*.tnzip
